msgstr "显示名称"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_close_log__draft_count
msgid "Draft settlements in the period when the event was logged."
msgstr "事件记录期间内的草稿结算单。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_mes_operation_report__x_piece_settled_label
msgid "Human-readable badge for the piece-settled column."
msgstr "计件已结算列的易读标记。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: D:\odoo\odoo19wsd\odoo\addons\base\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_participant__employee_code
msgid "ID used for employee identification."
msgstr "用于员工识别的ID。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\addons\account\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_close_wizard__write_uid
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_generate_wizard__write_uid
msgid "Last Updated by"
msgstr "最后更新人"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\addons\account\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_close_wizard__write_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_generate_wizard__write_date
msgid "Last Updated on"
msgstr "上次更新日期"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_participant__settlement_date
msgid ""
"Ledger month and monthly closing follow this date, not the creation date "
"(late settlements are back-dated)."
msgstr "台账月份与月度结账按此日期而非创建日期归集（补录结算会回填日期）。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_generate_wizard__report_ids
msgid "Only reports without a non-void settlement can be selected."
msgstr "只能选择没有非作废结算单的报工记录。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:res.groups,name:sn_wsd_piece_rate.group_piece_rate_manager
msgid "Piece-rate Manager"
msgstr "计件工资经理"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:res.groups,name:sn_wsd_piece_rate.group_piece_rate_user
msgid "Piece-rate User"
msgstr "计件工资用户"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\myaddons\sn_wsd_api\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__production_line_id
msgid "Production Line"
msgstr "生产线"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__serial_identity_ids
msgid ""
"SNs whose first OK pass at this operation is paid by this settlement "
"(station mode). Voiding releases them."
msgstr "本工序首次 OK 过站由本结算单付款的 SN（工位模式）。作废后即释放。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__unsettled_qty
msgid ""
"Station mode: SN count with a first OK pass at this operation not yet "
"covered by any non-void settlement."
msgstr "工位模式：本工序首次 OK 过站、尚未被任何非作废结算单覆盖的 SN 数量。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\myaddons\sn_wsd_mrp\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__manage_mode
msgid ""
"Station: SNs enter/leave each operation one by one.\n"
"Report: operations are reported by quantity, no SN tracking.\n"
"Locked once the order goes online."
msgstr ""
"过站：SN 逐个进出每道工序。\n"
"报工：按数量报工，不跟踪 SN。\n"
"订单上线后锁定。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__allocated_total
msgid ""
"Sum of allocated amounts. May be a few cents below the settlement amount: "
"rounding remainders are dropped."
msgstr "已分摊金额之和。可能比结算金额少几分：舍入尾差已丢弃。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__ratio_total
msgid "Sum of participant performance ratios; must be 100%."
msgstr "参与人绩效比例之和；必须为 100%。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__team_id
msgid ""
"Team used to pre-fill participants and their performance ratios (normalized "
"over the participating subset)."
msgstr "用于预填参与人及其绩效比例的班组（按实际参与人员归一化）。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__month_closed
msgid ""
"The business-date month is closed: no new settlements, no confirming, no "
"voiding until a manager reopens it."
msgstr "该业务日期月份已结账：在经理重新打开之前，不能新建、确认或作废结算单。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_mes_operation_report__x_piece_settled
msgid "True when a non-void piece settlement references this report."
msgstr "存在引用本报工的非作废计件结算单时为真。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__price
msgid ""
"Unit price resolved from the rate table when the settlement was sourced. "
"Later rate changes do not affect it."
msgstr "结算取数时从单价表解析出的单价。之后的单价变更不影响它。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement_participant__x_ratio_baseline
msgid ""
"Weight used to auto-redistribute the leftover ratio: rows the user typed "
"over (ratio != baseline) keep their value, the rest share the remainder "
"proportionally to their baseline."
msgstr "用于自动重分配剩余比例的权重：用户手工改过的行（比例 != 基线）保留原值，其余按基线比例分摊剩余部分。"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\myaddons\sn_wsd_api\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_piece_rate.field_sn_wsd_piece_settlement__workshop_id
msgid "Workshop"
msgstr "车间"

#. module: sn_wsd_piece_rate
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\addons\account\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sn_wsd_piece_rate.view_sn_wsd_piece_participant_search
msgid "Group By"
msgstr "分组方式"

